  "prefLabel": "Puc 2502.37 Small thermal source",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2502.37 “Small thermal source” means a source with a total gross nameplate heating capacity of its REC eligible units, combined, of 1,000,000 Btu per hour or less of heat input.\n\nSource. #10741, eff 12-5-14; ss by #12473, eff 2-1-18 (formerly Puc 2502.35)",
